#. ERPNext: "\n\t\t\tThe Batch {0} of an item {1} has negative stock in the warehouse {2}{3}.\n\t\t\tPlease add a stock quantity of {4} to proceed with this entry.\n\t\t\tIf it is not possible to make an adjustment entry, please enable 'Allow Negative Stock for Batch' in the batch {0} or in the Stock Settings to proceed.\n\t\t\tHowever, enabling this setting may lead to negative stock in the system.\n\t\t\tSo please ensure the stock levels are adjusted as soon as possible to maintain the correct valuation rate."
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/serial_and_batch_bundle/serial_and_batch_bundle.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"\t\t\tThe Batch {0} of an item {1} has negative stock in the warehouse {2}{3}.\n"
"\t\t\tPlease add a stock quantity of {4} to proceed with this entry.\n"
"\t\t\tIf it is not possible to make an adjustment entry, please enable 'Allow Negative Stock for Batch' in the batch {0} or in the Stock Settings to proceed.\n"
"\t\t\tHowever, enabling this setting may lead to negative stock in the system.\n"
"\t\t\tSo please ensure the stock levels are adjusted as soon as possible to maintain the correct valuation rate."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\t\t\tEl lote {0} del artículo {1} tiene existencias negativas en el almacén {2}{3}.\n"
"\t\t\tAgrega una cantidad de existencias de {4} para continuar con este movimiento.\n"
"\t\t\tSi no es posible hacer un movimiento de ajuste, habilita 'Permitir existencias negativas para lote' en el lote {0} o en la Configuración de inventario para continuar.\n"
"\t\t\tSin embargo, habilitar esta configuración puede generar existencias negativas en el sistema.\n"
"\t\t\tAsegúrate de ajustar los niveles de existencias lo antes posible para mantener la tasa de valoración correcta."

#. ERPNext: ""
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/serial_and_batch_bundle/serial_and_batch_bundle.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"\t\t\tThe Batch {0} of an item {1} has negative stock in the warehouse {2}{3}.\n"
"\t\t\tPlease add a stock quantity of {4} to proceed with this entry.\n"
"\t\t\tIf it is not possible to make an adjustment entry, please enable 'Allow Negative Stock for Batch' in the batch {0} or Stock Settings to proceed.\n"
"\t\t\tHowever, enabling this setting may lead to negative stock in the system.\n"
"\t\t\tSo please ensure the stock levels are adjusted as soon as possible to maintain the correct valuation rate."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\t\t\tEl lote {0} del artículo {1} tiene existencias negativas en el almacén {2}{3}.\n"
"\t\t\tAgrega una cantidad de existencias de {4} para continuar con este movimiento.\n"
"\t\t\tSi no es posible realizar un movimiento de ajuste, habilita 'Permitir existencias negativas para el lote' en el lote {0} o en la Configuración de inventario para continuar.\n"
"\t\t\tSin embargo, habilitar esta opción puede generar existencias negativas en el sistema.\n"
"\t\t\tPor lo tanto, asegúrate de ajustar los niveles de existencias lo antes posible para mantener la tasa de valoración correcta."

